{"4003590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Gambler: All In, No Out", "steam_appid": 4003590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/b1d062e7d93a892573a3511ac24c3d3c.poster.avif?t=1784645651\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/b1d062e7d93a892573a3511ac24c3d3c.webm?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/b1d062e7d93a892573a3511ac24c3d3c.mp4?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🦴 <strong>There's no escape </strong>🦴</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/3d91a75abcd6670feac91dcc06cd9fa2.poster.avif?t=1784645651\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/3d91a75abcd6670feac91dcc06cd9fa2.webm?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/3d91a75abcd6670feac91dcc06cd9fa2.mp4?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You face Skeleton - the ruler of the Kingdom of Bones. <br>He loves to play. Especially with those who think they’re good at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And you will lose.<br>Find gold, repay the debt, and maybe… win it all back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the timer is ticking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What Awaits You?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Gambler: All In, No Out is a turn-based dungeon crawler RPG with visual novel elements and gambling madness, set in an 80s retro-fantasy world. You are not a hero. You are a debtor. You sat down with the Skeleton, the mad ruler of the Kingdom of Bones, and lost everything. Now you are trapped in his maze, and the “Exit” button is locked by the magic of debt. Alt+F4 won’t help. The only way out is to gather gold in the depths of the dungeon and settle your account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/196f4e5551711ab89992a7e65a363892.poster.avif?t=1784645651\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/196f4e5551711ab89992a7e65a363892.webm?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/196f4e5551711ab89992a7e65a363892.mp4?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Games, Games, GAMES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skelly loves games. The dungeon is full of them. Cards. Dice. Wheels. Coins. Games you've seen before, and games that should never have existed. Every wager has its own rules, tricks, and ways to win. Learn the odds, exploit the mechanics, and find the edge. Or trust your luck and watch your savings disappear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your Money Is Your Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gold is your health, and every decision a tactical dilemma. Spend coins on survival and gear, or save them to buy back your soul. Every bet in the Skeleton’s games can bring you closer to freedom or kill you instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/47e1931708ee2e9438d80862b78d9abc.poster.avif?t=1784645651\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/47e1931708ee2e9438d80862b78d9abc.webm?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/47e1931708ee2e9438d80862b78d9abc.mp4?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Turn-Based Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors inspired by PS1 classics. The world moves only when you do, giving you full control over every step. To survive the depths, you’ll need to use everything you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/b1d062e7d93a892573a3511ac24c3d3c.poster.avif?t=1784645651\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/b1d062e7d93a892573a3511ac24c3d3c.webm?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003590/extras/b1d062e7d93a892573a3511ac24c3d3c.mp4?t=1784645651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🦴 <strong>There's no escape </strong>🦴</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"